  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Warpmeld Pact",
    "summary": "Your **TZEENTCH MUTANT INFANTRY** and **TZEENTCH MUTANT MOUNTED** units may perform a Warpmeld Sacrifice in either of these cases:\n\n- When an enemy unit picked to shoot or fight targets the unit: for the rest of the phase, attacks aimed at it get -1 to their **Wound rolls**.\n- When the unit is picked to shoot or fight, ahead of choosing its targets: for the rest of the phase, its models' attacks get +1 to their Wound rolls.\n\nA **TZEENTCH MUTANT** unit that does so suffers D3 **mortal wounds** as that phase ends.",
